{
  "id": "c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Influencers and authenticity",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, which people do you follow online, and why?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how much of what you see online do you think is real?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, have you ever bought something because of a recommendation online?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how do you think social media has changed the way people see themselves?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e28-a1",
            "c1-e28-a2",
            "c1-e28-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people involved in creating or viewing online content. Choose two of the pictures and say why the people might be doing this, and how the content might affect them.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these situations do you find the most worrying?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e28-b1",
            "c1-e28-b2",
            "c1-e28-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show the effects of online popularity. Choose two of the pictures and say how the people might be feeling, and what pressures they could face.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think online fame is as valuable as real success?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some effects that influencers can have on their followers, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11200
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these effects influence young people?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which has the greatest impact?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about influencers and authenticity online.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent should influencers be made to say clearly when they are being paid to promote something?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think followers are too trusting of influencers?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, is there a danger that online life is replacing real life for many young people?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Would you consider a career as an influencer to be a serious choice?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, how can people protect their self-esteem when they use social media?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should there be age limits on who can become an influencer?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e28-influencers-and-authenticity/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
